graphic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A printer for wrapping paper comprises a cartridge holder (40) having an ink nozzle (18) on the outer surface and capable of receiving an ink cartridge (50) therein, an ink feed passage (79) formed in the cartridge holder (40) and establishing communication between the ink cartridge (50) and the ink nozzle (18), and a linear actuator (80) supported by the cartridge holder (40) for pushing a plunger (52) inside the ink cartridge (50) into ink cartridge (50).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une imprimeuse pour papier d'emballage, qui comprend un support de cartouche (40) comportant sur sa surface extérieure une buse à encre (18) et pouvant recevoir une cartouche d'encre (50), un passage d'alimentation en encre (79) ménagé dans le support de cartouche (40) et faisant communiquer la cartouche d'encre (50) et la buse à encre (18), et un actionneur linéaire (80) porté par le support de cartouche (40) pour pousser un plongeur (52) à l'intérieur de la cartouche d'encre (50).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>